//   | | | +-ChatQuestion-----------------------------------+ | | |
//   | | | | [ChatQuestionQuote]  ChatQuestionText          | | | |
//   | | | +------------------------------------------------+ | | |
//   | | | [ChatSiblings:  <  2 of 3  >]                      | | |
//   | | | +-ChatAnswer-------------------------------------+ | | |
//   | | | | ChatAnswerMarkdown, its quote marks, highlight | | | |
//   | | | +------------------------------------------------+ | | |
//   | | +----------------------------------------------------+ | |
//   | | +-ChatPending (the question in flight, if any)-----+ | |
//   | | | ChatQuestion   ChatPendingAnswer                  | | |
//   | | +----------------------------------------------------+ | |
//   | +--------------------------------------------------------+ |
//   +----------------------------------------------------------+
